<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADS ENDS UP AT $45-1/2 (FIM 208.07).</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADS ENDS UP AT $45-1/2 (FIM 208.07).</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia's A share ADS closed up $1-1/2 at $45-1/2 in New York on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Its Wall Street closing equals about 208.07 markka. In Helsinki Wednesday, Nokia A closed up 0.80 markka at 202.00.</p>
<p>Valmet's ADS (two shares) closed $0-5/8 higher at $33-3/4 on Wall Street. The price equals about 77.17 markka. In Helsinki, Valmet closed down 0.10 markka at 76.20.</p>
<p>Rauma's ADS was untraded in New York.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-0-680 50 240</p>
